<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,computed,onBeforeUnmount,watch} from 'vue'
import {request} from '../api'
const props=defineProps<{value:any;disabled?:boolean}>()
const visibleHeaders=ref(new Set<number>()),bodyVisible=ref(false),preview=ref<any>(),previewBusy=ref(false),error=ref('')
const method=computed(()=>props.value.method||'GET')
const variables=['title','content','name','date','days_left','years','calendar_type']
const insertion=ref<'url'|'body'>('url')
let generation=0,alive=true
watch(()=>props.value,()=>{generation++;preview.value=undefined},{deep:true})
onBeforeUnmount(()=>{alive=false;generation++})
function toggleHeader(index:number){const next=new Set(visibleHeaders.value);if(next.has(index))next.delete(index);else next.add(index);visibleHeaders.value=next}
function addHeader(){(props.value.headers||=[]).push({name:'Authorization',value:''})}
function insert(name:string){if(insertion.value==='body'&&method.value==='POST'){props.value.body_template=(props.value.body_template||'')+'{'+name+'}';bodyVisible.value=true}else props.value.url_template=(props.value.url_template||'')+'{'+name+'}'}
async function showPreview(){if(previewBusy.value)return;const g=++generation;previewBusy.value=true;error.value='';try{const result=await request('/admin/calendar/notification/preview',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(props.value)});if(alive&&g===generation)preview.value=result}catch{if(alive)error.value='请求模板预览失败，请检查变量、JSON格式或请求头；未发送外部请求。'}finally{if(alive)previewBusy.value=false}}
</script>
<template><section class="advanced-notification"><label>请求方式<select aria-label="请求方式" v-model="value.method" :disabled="disabled"><option value="GET">GET（兼容原配置）</option><option value="POST">POST</option></select></label><fieldset :disabled="disabled"><legend>自定义业务请求头</legend><div v-for="(header,index) in value.headers||[]" :key="index" class="notify-header"><label>请求头名称<input v-model="header.name" maxlength="64" autocomplete="off"/></label><label>请求头值<input v-model="header.value" :type="visibleHeaders.has(index)?'text':'password'" maxlength="2048" autocomplete="off" :spellcheck="false"/></label><button type="button" class="quiet" :aria-pressed="visibleHeaders.has(index)" @click="toggleHeader(index)">{{visibleHeaders.has(index)?'隐藏值':'查看值'}}</button><button type="button" class="quiet" @click="value.headers.splice(index,1);visibleHeaders=new Set()">移除请求头</button></div><button type="button" class="quiet" :disabled="(value.headers?.length||0)>=20" @click="addHeader">添加请求头</button><p>最多20组；可使用Authorization或业务Token。Host、Content-Type及传输控制字段由系统管理，不能覆盖。</p></fieldset><section v-if="method==='POST'"><label>请求体格式<select aria-label="请求体格式" v-model="value.body_format" :disabled="disabled"><option value="json">JSON</option><option value="form">表单 application/x-www-form-urlencoded</option><option value="text">纯文本</option></select></label><button type="button" class="quiet" :aria-expanded="bodyVisible" @click="bodyVisible=!bodyVisible">{{bodyVisible?'隐藏请求体':'查看 / 编辑请求体'}}</button><label v-if="bodyVisible">请求体模板<textarea v-model="value.body_template" aria-label="请求体模板" rows="8" maxlength="32000" :disabled="disabled" autocomplete="off" :spellcheck="false"/></label><p v-else>请求体默认隐藏，避免误展示凭据。主动查看后请留意屏幕和截图。</p><p>JSON直接使用正常结构花括号，仅字符串值替换变量；支持嵌套对象、数组、数字、布尔值和null。表单使用键=值，嵌套JSON放在参数值中。</p></section><label>变量插入位置<select aria-label="变量插入位置" v-model="insertion"><option value="url">URL末尾</option><option v-if="method==='POST'" value="body">请求体末尾</option></select></label><div class="notification-variables"><button v-for="name in variables" :key="name" type="button" class="quiet" :disabled="disabled" @click="insert(name)">{{'{'+name+'}'}}</button></div><button type="button" class="quiet" :disabled="disabled||previewBusy" @click="showPreview">预览请求（不发送）</button><p role="status">{{error}}</p><pre v-if="preview" aria-label="脱敏请求预览">{{JSON.stringify(preview,null,2)}}</pre><p>GET复杂查询支持 <code>content={}</code> 或 <code>content={&quot;title&quot;:&quot;{title}&quot;}</code>。固定参数值中的&amp;与#须百分号编码；变量值由系统编码一次。</p><p>预览整体隐藏路径、查询和请求体值。HTTP成功不等于平台业务成功或终端收到；POST结果不确定时先核对外部结果，勿盲目重试。</p></section></template>
<style scoped>.advanced-notification{min-width:0;margin-block:14px}.advanced-notification fieldset{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;min-width:0}.advanced-notification label{display:block;margin-block:10px}.advanced-notification input,.advanced-notification textarea,.advanced-notification select{width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.notify-header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:8px}.notify-header button{justify-self:start}.notification-variables{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-block:10px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}p{overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:500px){.notify-header{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}</style>
